        },
        {
          "text": "Mu kwezi kw’indwi, ku musi wakwo wa mbere, muze mukoranywe no kuba ikoraniro ryera; ntihaze hagire igikorwa kiruhisha muwukorako: muze muwugire umusi wo kuvuzakw inzamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muze muwutangekw ikimazi co kwoswa c’ umubabge ummotera neza, jewe Uhoraho; kize kibe imasa y’ umukangara imwe, n’impfizi y’ intama imwe, n’abana b’intama ndwi b’amasuguru, batarengeje umwaka, batagira agasembga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hamwe n’ishikanwa ry’ifu bigendanye, ifu igogōretse ivanzwe n’ amavuta ya elayo; iryo ku masa ribe ibigiracumi bitatu vy’ingero yitwa efa, iryo ku mpfizi y’intama ribe ibigiracumi bibiri vya efa nyene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iryo ku mwana w’intama umwe‐umwe mur’ abo, ukw ar’ indwi, ribe ikigiracumi kimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muze mutange n’impfizi y’impene imwe kw ikimazi gitangirwa ivyaha, co kubabera impongano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
