        {
          "text": "Kandi ku musi ugira icumi na gatanu w’ukwo kwezi kw’indwi muze mukoranywe no kuba ikoraniro ryera; ntimuze mugire igikorwa kiruhisha muwukorako, kandi muze mumare imisi ndwi muri mu misi mikuru yo kunyubaha, jewe Uhoraho. ",
