        },
        {
          "text": "Mubitangane n’ishikanwa ry’ ifu rigendana na vyo, ifu igogōretse ivanzwe n’amavuta ya elayo; iryo ku masa imwe‐imwe mur’ ayo, ukw ar’icumi n’atatu, ribe ibigiracumi bitatu vya efa, iryo ku mpfizi y’intama imwe‐imwe mur’ izo, ukw ari zibiri, ribe ibigiracumi bibiri vya efa nyene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
